      "diff": "@@ -205,6 +205,7 @@ management.\n // without compiling Qt oneself while setting a special flag:\n // https://bugreports.qt.io/browse/QTBUG-134075\n \n+* Wireshark 4.6 was the last release branch to officially support Windows 10, version 1809 and Windows Server 2019.\n * Wireshark 4.4 was the last release branch to officially support Windows 10, version 1607 and Windows Server 2016.\n * Wireshark 4.0 was the last release branch to officially support Windows 8.1 and Windows Server 2012.\n * Wireshark 3.6 was the last release branch to officially support 32-bit Windows.\n",
